* mv_cmd — a command framework for MultiValue BASIC (cut-down copy bundled in
* mvpkg so it runs standalone; the full mvx-lang/cmd overrides it when installed).
* Copyright (C) 2026 Gordon Heydon.  GPL-2.0-only (see LICENSE).
*
* CMD.ADD(subcommand, description, handler-subroutine) — register a subcommand
* and its handler.  Platform-neutral (no idiom diff), so this one source compiles
* for both MVX and UniData.
   SUBROUTINE CMD.ADD(CSUB, DESC, HANDLER)
   COMMON /CMDPKG/ CNAME, CDESC, CSUBS, CDESCS, CHANDLERS
   CSUBS<-1> = OCONV(CSUB, "MCU")
   CDESCS<-1> = DESC
   CHANDLERS<-1> = HANDLER
   RETURN